    "sections": {
        "description": "The Wedding Ceremony WordPress Theme is designed for couples, planners, and professionals who want to create an unforgettable digital experience for their big day. This theme is ideal for showcasing wedding venues, wedding ideas, and all aspects of wedding planning, from invitations to the reception. Built with elegance and functionality in mind, it allows users to beautifully display wedding elements such as wedding dresses, wedding flowers, wedding rings, and wedding themes. Whether you're planning a rustic wedding, a luxury event, or a destination wedding, this theme caters to all styles. One of its biggest benefits is its customizable design, allowing you to craft a unique wedding website that reflects your wedding colour schemes, seating chart, and wedding budget. The theme’s responsive layout ensures that your site looks stunning across all devices, making it easy for guests to RSVP, view the wedding day timeline, and explore wedding venues or catering options. It also includes sections for wedding invitations, wedding cakes, and wedding favours. Visually, this theme offers clean, sophisticated layouts with plenty of space for high-resolution imagery of wedding decorations, wedding arches, and more. Dedicated sections for wedding videography, wedding entertainment, and wedding music create a fully immersive experience for your guests."
    },
